OL,3,GNEWSANew #16.4m special school moves
OL,4,Astep closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new special school in
OL,7,FWolverhampton have been given the green
OL,8,Flight, a month after #16.4m in funding
OL,9,Fwas approved by the city council.
OL,11,FBroadmeadow Special School planned for
OL,12,FPendeford would replace the existing
OL,13,FBroadmeadow School at West Park,
OL,14,Fincreasing capacity from 75 to 120
OL,15,Fplaces and extending provision from
OL,16,Fages three to 11 years to three to 19.
OL,18,FThe project, still to be signed off by
OL,19,Fthe Department for Education, was
OL,20,Fdesigned to help meet growing demand
OL,21,Ffor places within the city, the council
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
