OL,3,GNEWSANew #16.4m special school moves
OL,4,Astep closer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The decision recognises the clear need
OL,7,Ffor additional specialist provision in
OL,8,FWolverhampton and brings us a step
OL,9,Fcloser to delivering this fantastic new
OL,10,Fschool," said councillor Jacqui Coogan.
